@startuml
title 05  事件发布 · DSH 插件与 DiOS 路由
skinparam backgroundColor #F9FBFE
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontColor #14273E
skinparam ArrowColor #446483
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam componentBorderColor #7595B4
skinparam nodeBorderColor #7896B2
skinparam databaseBorderColor #7896B2
skinparam artifactBorderColor #7896B2
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2FF
    ParticipantBorderColor #7595B4
    LifeLineBorderColor #94A9BF
    GroupBackgroundColor #EDF6F3
    GroupBorderColor #8EADA2
    ReferenceBackgroundColor #EDF6F3
    ReferenceBorderColor #8EADA2
}
hide footbox
participant "DSH Agent 循环" as Agent
participant "HQIT publish_event 插件" as Plugin
participant "DiOS 事件入口" as OS
participant "DiOS 路由与调度" as Dispatch
participant "目标 DiAgent 容器" as Next

Agent -> Plugin : event_type, source, subject, data
Plugin -> OS : 读取事件目录与来源规则
OS --> Plugin : 事件类型与来源规则
alt 插件检查通过
    Plugin -> OS : POST /api/os/events/manual
    OS -> Dispatch : 匹配订阅并处理派发
    opt 策略允许且命中订阅
        Dispatch -> Next : 经 A2A 发起 task / service
    end
    Dispatch --> OS : 事件状态与派发结果
    OS --> Plugin : event_id、状态与匹配信息
    Plugin --> Agent : 返回发布结果
else 规则拒绝或请求失败
    Plugin --> Agent : 可诊断的拒绝 / 失败结果
end
note over Plugin, Dispatch
  事件状态随工具结果返回。
  目标任务的执行结果由 DiOS 单独跟踪。
end note
@enduml
